  "deviations": [
    "test-inventory.json was generated after the tests were written, not before implementation as the plan orders; REG-14 validates it mechanically.",
    "WP2 (Skill/reference/example) and WP3 (tests/sync/generated package) share one commit because the documented script path and generated package must land together for check-source.",
    "Runtime handoff records live at <context-root>/<task-id>/handoff/<handoff-id>.json (existing v1 path); the plan text says handoffs/. The preflight uses the runtime path helper and does not change v1.",
    "The plan lists example error codes; the preflight adds registered codes (e.g. PREFLIGHT_AUTHORITY_CONFLICT, PREFLIGHT_WORKTREE_DIRTY, PREFLIGHT_PACKAGE_SHA_MISSING, PREFLIGHT_UNEXPECTED_ERROR), each with one fixed status class.",
    "The fixed full-test command yields 1 skip unless MLTC_LEGACY_PACKAGE names the frozen 0.7.0 package, which currently exists only under local /private/tmp.",
    "Strict status maps confirmed_not_committed (pending or cancelled) to control_transfer=fail with no controller generation.",
    "The preflight reads existing private runtime helpers (_capture_prepare_inputs, _control_projection, _read_handoff_json, _paths) without modifying them.",
    "Root skill-package.json required_paths now also lists scripts/handoff_preflight.py and tests/test_handoff_preflight.py.",
    "The packaged example now needs a git executable.",
    "C02 (fixed full-test command) failed on its first attempt: 3 pre-existing timing-sensitive tests in test_truth_sources (child process must exit within 2 s) under host load averages of roughly 50-60. Not caused by this change (C17); reruns pass (C16, C02b). Flakiness risk remains for loaded hosts and CI."
  ],
